              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izisekelo zogange lomuzi zazihlotshiswe ngawo wonke amatshe anenani. Isisekelo sokuqala sasiyijaspi; eyesibili isafire; eyesithathu ikalkedoni; eyesine iyisimaragidu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
