          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyesihlanu isardoniksi; eyesithupha yisardiyu; eyesikhombisa ikrizolithe; eyesishiyagalombili ikrisolite; eyesishiyagalolunye yitopazi; eyeshumi yikrisoprasu; eyeshumi nanye yihiyakinte; eyeshumi nambili, i-amethiste.",
